{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "1a3a46c3b84d4ec0ceb5ce6ec3e226544cb056a90739e17cbd7e694229757233", "ja": "『Cleasky』へ", "zh": "迈向『Cleasky』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "89a13c3d2b0bbb15bc02f5d3bbdb5bc5902cf825cb4cafabd4f955ab10a4b425", "ja": "社長と小鳥の話を聞くエレナと美也。\nプロデューサーの言葉をきっかけに、ついに\n答えを見出す。翌日、そろそろユニット名を\n決めようかと言うプロデューサーに、2人は\n自分たちで考えてきたとその名を告げる。", "zh": "艾琳娜和美也去向社长跟小鸟请教。\n在制作人的指引之下，\n她们终于找到解答。\n隔天，制作人说差不多该敲定团体名称时，\n她们俩说出了自己想到的名称。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0bb98a1e0b5c72df694020b37d1f3432fe80b04e4194f6ab3f34eef0ce9a11ce", "ja": "失礼します。お疲れさまです。", "zh": "不好意思打扰，工作辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "5406f3221ae6d3e4bf18f24f2e7a2fb8b717424e021ec37b4b474d89a367fceb", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん！\nそれに……。", "zh": "哎呀，是{$P$}先生！\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ba7d4e9eabea2548b224403297cb443910c58c68b1697647fecf6f5a8093da4", "ja": "たのも～！", "zh": "有人在吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "0d45d948638d6a16956a8c281c8df47107fdc22e41f685721f72b312773f3cec", "ja": "たのも～。", "zh": "有人在吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "fe93e75aa8b2043b34ff70bcb70cb69889794cc6030cfc17e74082b8a50f4846", "ja": "エレナちゃんに美也ちゃんも、お疲れさま！\nでも、ふたりが事務所に来るなんて珍しいわね？", "zh": "艾琳娜跟美也也来了，辛苦了！\n不过，真难得在事务所看到你们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "ee502e0ecf03fab66f1ade5d54c413145a9609216063208c6f655f5d6cadb9d1", "ja": "ワタシ達、青春について話が聞きたいノ！", "zh": "我们，想要请教有关青春的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "85dd95a1095a1d4bf0ec6e0a9b32f4a1fec9e72159b1b82bedca8695c1117a1b", "ja": "青春？", "zh": "青春？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "87ff18eddc6c1566a8813e4fad72db92e16f5a52d5c36bb709a0a51addbda704", "ja": "この前、ミヤと将棋センターのおじいちゃん達に\n話を聞いたのが、すっごく面白かったんだヨ～！", "zh": "前几天，我跟美也去找将棋中心的\n老爷爷们聊天，真的很有趣～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "22714aa8a36771f24f812ebe60446b3f87fcb2b3cde07319bd4ea5e6b7434cdf", "ja": "なので、ここは人生の先輩に聞くのが\nいいんじゃないかと思いまして～。", "zh": "所以我们在想是不是该多去\n请教几位人生方面的前辈～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "77e820f26b0f8cecc1f3f3c0e5d15c3152374caed71fb6a19691ccc082b68f00", "ja": "それで、身近な人生の先輩……という事で、\n事務所に連れてきました。", "zh": "然后说到身边有哪几位是人生的前辈……\n我就带她们俩来事务所了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "771b71ae2d095cc212f37d6c558974a209de09ccee901c5ba20a7b0c3f72a956", "ja": "なるほど、人生の……せ、先輩！？\nそれって高木社長のことかしら……？", "zh": "原来是这样，人生的…‥前、前辈！？\n你们是指高木社长吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "70d6be960b7cefa345cfab02aa0c73ef15a9f1810cf56df96091f8b94d673c3a", "ja": "シャチョーと、あとコトリもだヨ！", "zh": "社长，跟小鸟都是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "b2a58faad8f048ae154fb138504f84085e85d9ec2b32cf197d510e0404836004", "ja": "あ、やっぱり私も入っちゃうんだ……うぅ……。", "zh": "唉，我果然也算在内……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4bf8b49bc7bf23763eced31639a81d98f320c3cb2e7c2b1bfcd0a5e0e6450b58", "ja": "音無さん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "音无小姐，你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "4abda5f6cad0829113050e4e8263d9ae6a86b4cfcd7c2f63ff3bc5cc8b76f6a8", "ja": "いえ、なんでもないです！\nそれじゃ、社長を呼んできますね。", "zh": "不，没事！\n那我去叫社长过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1015_president", "source_sha256": "faa8eacbbc163008368a3ab91ab26175bc7df2fa49144f4a100ade4b819fdb90", "ja": "……ほう、ほうほう。なるほど……。\n『爽やかな春の風』で『青春』か！　流石だよ、君！", "zh": "……哦？哦哦。原来如此……\n从『爽朗春风』延伸到『青春』啊！真佩服你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1016_president", "source_sha256": "05ae63e007455adc2ef656d10fd9c744fc8bbd715dafc872c8163c56ed7a83ad", "ja": "青春か……。\n私も昔は、ブイブイいわせたものだ！", "zh": "青春啊……\n我以前也是让人噗噗叫的小子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "c774f525aa7b7d4fe62606d2c24237732a0dd53f19e992fd01f3eb078ab0e8ca", "ja": "ブイブイ？\n……トモカの、コブタちゃん達の鳴き声かナ？", "zh": "噗噗叫？\n……是朋花小猪们的叫声吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1018_president", "source_sha256": "080de89a28a3249c32b386c6e8bf3677ff4c3b4045e58df6ffedf470ecf551d0", "ja": "フフ、私自身の話だよ。学生時代は、\nたくさんの仲間に囲まれていてね。楽しかったなぁ。", "zh": "呵呵，是在讲我自己的事啦。在我学生时期，\n总有许多伙伴在身旁，想想真是开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1019_president", "source_sha256": "de10d56fe82bac2a0d1c2eeb50f6ec2169f3a9efa782811831ae3332af738058", "ja": "無論、今もだがね！　頼りになるプロデューサー、\nそれに魅力的なアイドル諸君、事務員のふたり……。", "zh": "当然，现在也是！身旁有可靠的制作人，\n还有魅力四射的各位偶像，跟两位事务员……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1020_president", "source_sha256": "d6dde10df21eec8bdf8720cd25ebbb866d9668a5e8690a752be8d41359b80edc", "ja": "皆のお陰で、我が765プロは日々成長し続けている。\n青春時代と同じ……いやそれ以上かな。実に楽しいよ！", "zh": "托各位的福，我们765艺能天天都在成长。\n跟青春时代一样……不，比那时还厉害，真的很开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "3fea600bf4d6221db35d86522d5b44f05aeaf78230131d75c4089d161ed33f43", "ja": "社長の青春は、今でも続いているってことですね。", "zh": "看来社长的青春到现在都还没结束呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1022_president", "source_sha256": "4cd413321f4bad82d694b8b91bd1beb6a4ad1af8500d6beaa971397ed7552b9b", "ja": "はは、そうかもしれないね！", "zh": "哈哈，或许是呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "f76b2ba797d800cbe06c665dd23d3a7124f429c7351ecfbab6a2de59fb1841fd", "ja": "青春……青春って、いいですよね。\n爽やかで、甘酸っぱくて、でも少しほろ苦くて……。", "zh": "青春……青春真的很美好呢。\n是那样爽朗、酸甜，但又有些苦涩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "4147b3f9f2c25dd21b86b0ec6684146fb1bbeb5be4ef0e8f1c8345c626362ca1", "ja": "何気ない日々や何でもない言葉でも、ちょっとした事で\n忘れられない思い出になったりするんですよね。", "zh": "即便是平凡的日子或庸俗的字句，\n也会因为一点小事化为难忘的回忆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1025_president", "source_sha256": "343fa3a99ea072446871f7ffbb055393ae94a3801fa8877c8b48f82e63ce6a19", "ja": "エレナ君、美也君。\n君達はまさに今、青春真っ盛りだ。", "zh": "艾琳娜、美也，\n你们正处在青春的当下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "1574aa26a06810c55ba97b83629927f0f11402e68bcfe0232c9a336f1d691a31", "ja": "む～ん……みんな、そう言うんですよ～。\n高校生活は短いから、楽しみなさいって……。", "zh": "唔～嗯……每个人都这么说～\n高中生活稍纵即逝，要享受当下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1027_president", "source_sha256": "5a7d3d4fef2734e0ea7c642100e93760bf8331455cdcafae0bd04b847ddde47d", "ja": "うむ。君達は、我が765プロの大切なアイドル。\nだがアイドルである事には、ある種の責任が伴う……。", "zh": "嗯，你们是我765艺能重要的偶像。\n但既然身为偶像，就有该履行的职责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "94f8f9251b53679f87871618a19104f60544488fcfc06379870b71349633dc31", "ja": "責任……。", "zh": "职责……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1030_president", "source_sha256": "7dbab1a5a9076c77b3990f51536a83b945bb79cc2d60bb20346b31ae4528ed4f", "ja": "しかし時には、アイドルであること以上に、今しかない\n時間……青春を楽しむことを、大切にしてくれたまえ！", "zh": "但有时候，享受仅存于当下的时光……享受青春，\n是比当偶像还更重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "d20ad19c2da7834ab253a7271e92c69f51ee339021e8a6aa9b9aaf2795472f1d", "ja": "シャチョーも、アズサと同じコト言ってたネ。\n青春を楽しめって……。", "zh": "社长跟梓都说了一样的话，\n要享受青春……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "aa7e9a45ad951be38fcb0aabd18a40eda76a40d774c35024401b8acec68c3abc", "ja": "じゃあやっぱり、ワタシ達は好きなコトをして\nたくさん遊べばいいのかナ？", "zh": "那这样到头来，我们是不是只要做自己喜欢的事，\n尽情地玩就好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "e8e7ee9a6e4c8aded765f456d873ec0e039b7174c6350aa59fc0ca68c1c22369", "ja": "でも、私達アイドルには、責任があるんですよね？\n{$P$}さん～。", "zh": "但我们身为偶像，还是有职责在身的吧？\n{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "fc3c350836d5315c3f8d8706b707ff4f2589f7391ca3bdabba6affda83addd8b", "ja": "そうだな……きっと高校生は、色々なことを\n自分で決められる、一番自由な年頃だと思うんだ。", "zh": "对啊……我想高中一定是能自主决定很多事情，\n一生中最无拘无束的时期吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "c0eff853f3c7763f8b038e7ada63bd5aec08799a0c61924bef1bdd85b6471ab7", "ja": "その可能性は、どこまでも広がってる。\nほら、ちょうどこの青空みたいに。", "zh": "这时候仿佛有无边无际的可能性。\n你们看，就像这片蓝天一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "837088fa1bdf4d5326ba37bd6afb794e73fa75cf0a3fe27a7c4ceae5869e4009", "ja": "青空みたいに……？", "zh": "像蓝天一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "e21b58411ca59a3fb4f7cbd23a574cfb0d6248aabe0ef2d4ecfb86356468b10e", "ja": "だからこそ青春は、誰にとっても思い出深くて、\nかけがえのない時期なんだろうな。", "zh": "正因为如此，青春才会是每人心中感慨万千、\n无可取代的时光吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1038_p", "source_sha256": "7e88f3a8285e4d9167c938e6e5c005df309ce005f69283732298ae31035f43e0", "ja": "遊びも勉強も、アイドルも……今のふたりにしかない\n可能性を、どんどん広げていってほしいと思うよ。", "zh": "不管是娱乐、课业还是偶像……我都希望\n你们可以尽量拓展自己在此时此刻的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "28c4a517ab1ab0ba475f3f59944f53c1b6ee08c1e30b28e9fd940d58ac8fd179", "ja": "なるほど～。今の私達は、青空なんですね～。", "zh": "原来如此～现在的我们，就像这片蓝天～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "bb4ea9c98f8a68248bc30578a47b49648da7e9e8a9ac6de666797eb6eea8967a", "ja": "なんとなくだけど、みんなの言ってるコト、\nわかってきたかもしれないヨ……。ミヤは、どう？", "zh": "虽然不是那么肯定，但我好像慢慢明白\n大家的意思了……美也呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1041_042miy", "source_sha256": "3048e5191a739f8e6b14ed07585290a89ad63644591ac175dd669e10992215f8", "ja": "私も、少しだけわかった気がしますよ～。\nエレナさん、さっそく作戦会議をしましょう～。", "zh": "我好像也有点懂了～\n艾琳娜，我们马上来开作战会议吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1043_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c044bda42fa4d862de95e49667fb982a0d5336be366c9a7c40d83ca1825eea0", "ja": "{$P$}、おまたせ！\nワタシ達のユニットでやりたいコト、決めてきたヨ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，久等了！\n我们这个团体想做的事，已经决定好啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1045_042miy", "source_sha256": "ecc27d725843c2ed68c435813a8db5b57a6b7bd05c82f6731ae4803c54701f5c", "ja": "私達は、今の私達のことが歌いたいです～。\n青春が過ぎてしまっても、忘れないように……。", "zh": "我们两个，想唱出当下的自己～\n哪怕青春逝去，也不会忘了这段时光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "2dd919d8a4897b7ddf30935b69990b1bd10c152954aff06a9f93bab68678d12c", "ja": "難しいコトじゃなくていいノ。\n学校のコトとか、トモダチとか、好きなヒトとか……。", "zh": "内容不用太复杂。\n唱唱学校也好、朋友也好、心上人也好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "dff2ad701b5df6566961041c869c89347a75f2ff4fbd54a4938c3cc536e0974a", "ja": "普通のコトかもしれないケド、そのほうが、\nみんなにも伝わるんじゃないかナって思ったんだヨ♪", "zh": "或许题材很平凡，\n但我们觉得这样更能感动大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1048_p", "source_sha256": "205a3e0500dae5a692de4331d8ba33568fc4c7781b67a3fcf98c303cc1ca1776", "ja": "なるほど……ふたりの気持ちは、わかったよ。\nあとは、そろそろユニット名を決めないとだな。", "zh": "原来如此……我明白你们的意思了。\n再来就是差不多该决定团体名了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1049_042miy", "source_sha256": "46fb0a36d65062012eef7ce3ebbeb852bebd1db20c76e4b913c3198f0f3ff1b1", "ja": "ユニット名なんですが、昨日、ふたりで\n考えてきたんですよ～。", "zh": "关于团体的名称，\n我们两个昨天一起想好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "7492c38430b13e4afcbbf6986dcc81bb9dc4c753488af1ae9eda5b807abb72ff", "ja": "{$P$}も、言ってたでしょ？\nワタシ達は、青空みたいだって♪", "zh": "{$P$}也有说过不是吗？\n我们就像蓝天一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0023_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_06_1051_042miy", "source_sha256": "86d5094d3daeca26b7a7e55b16ff6aeca1e6ff61ba75dea0c7728e7e814c6c27", "ja": "晴天という意味の『Clear sky』。\n『Clear』と『sky』の手を繋げて～。せーの！", "zh": "就用晴空的英文『Clear sky』，\n然后把『Clear』跟『sky』的手牵起来～一、二！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
